WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.056
- And I worked at Barneys, New
York, the original Barney's

00:00:02.056 --> 00:00:05.451
in New York-- it's the title.
- That's fancy.

00:00:05.451 --> 00:00:07.460
I had no business working there.

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:09.590
I had to like borrow clothes.

00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:12.618
I had to shop at discount stores
to look nice enough to work

00:00:12.618 --> 00:00:13.614
at Barneys, New York.

00:00:13.614 --> 00:00:15.515
- [Kelly] That's kind of funny and ironic.

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:17.104
- Yes.
(audience laughing)

00:00:17.104 --> 00:00:18.330
- You should buy this.
- [Guest] Yes.

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:19.866
I mean, I'm not wearing it.
- Exactly.

00:00:19.866 --> 00:00:22.390
- So I worked at Barneys during the day,

00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:24.463
and then I worked at the
comedy club at night.

00:00:24.463 --> 00:00:27.284
The cool thing about
working at Barney's is that

00:00:27.284 --> 00:00:30.590
it became this like, place for me.

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:32.700
It was sort of like a-- (stammering)

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:35.380
gauge of how I was doing
in life or something.

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:39.160
And like the first time
I kind of had any money,

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:40.210
I would like shopped there.

00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:41.920
It was kind of a cool thing to be like,

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:44.529
I used to work here and
now I can afford something.

00:00:44.529 --> 00:00:45.362
- Amen.

00:00:45.362 --> 00:00:48.790
- And then it was an even
kind of like bigger deal.

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:52.031
One day I was shopping
there and the security guard

00:00:52.031 --> 00:00:53.560
came over and he was like,

00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:56.410
I just want you to know
there are paparazzi outside.

00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:58.519
First of all, the security
guard like recognized me

00:00:58.519 --> 00:01:01.490
was like a moment, and
that he was like worried

00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:03.012
about my paparazzi, you know.

00:01:03.012 --> 00:01:04.070
- That's amazing.

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:04.903
- I know!

00:01:04.903 --> 00:01:06.110
And he was like, I'll walk you to the car.

00:01:06.110 --> 00:01:07.720
And I was like, thanks.
(audience laughing)

00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:09.050
I'm so worried.
(Kelly clapping)

00:01:09.050 --> 00:01:10.897
I'm so concerned for my safety.

00:01:10.897 --> 00:01:11.730
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:15.551
So, I finished my shopping
and I, you know, I was like

00:01:15.551 --> 00:01:17.180
thank you so much, sir.

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:18.410
I'm ready to go to the car.

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:21.260
And he like walks me out

00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:25.153
to the car and nobody took my picture.

00:01:25.153 --> 00:01:25.986
(audience laughing)

00:01:25.986 --> 00:01:27.209
- Oh my God, was someone else there?

00:01:27.209 --> 00:01:29.374
- So I like get in my car.

00:01:29.374 --> 00:01:31.801
And he was like so confused.

00:01:31.801 --> 00:01:33.588
And I was, I was like,

00:01:33.588 --> 00:01:36.250
Oh they must not be here for me.

00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:39.510
And he's like, well, yeah,
Gwen Stephani is also here.

00:01:39.510 --> 00:01:43.440
- Oh my gosh, that's awesome!
(audience laughing)

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:44.460
- And it was real moment.

00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:49.460
Cause I was like, Oh, well I
guess it's not quite there.

00:01:50.010 --> 00:01:51.236
- I've been offered a job.

00:01:51.236 --> 00:01:52.890
In like an interior design place.

00:01:52.890 --> 00:01:54.710
I was doing things to my
thing, and the lady goes,

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:56.108
do you have, do you
need like a second job?

00:01:56.108 --> 00:01:57.927
Or like any-- and she
had no idea who I was.

00:01:57.927 --> 00:02:00.650
And I was like flattered
because she liked my taste.

00:02:00.650 --> 00:02:02.580
At the same time I was like,
still haven't quite made it.

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:03.879
She doesn't know who I am.

00:02:03.879 --> 00:02:04.712
(Kelly and guest laughing)

00:02:04.712 --> 00:02:05.545
I was like, cool.

00:02:05.545 --> 00:02:07.680
Anyway, I could keep
going with those moments.

